# Design system

Two skins via `document.documentElement.dataset.skin` and `useSkin()`.

**Brand refresh (default):** ink header, tan slabs, black reviews bar, uppercase Schedule, teal visit block.

**Studio:** white header, photo-first hero, quiet trust line, white visit card, light footer. Same teal accent.

ROI extras on both skins: Insurance nav, Emergency? Call, Cases strip, stepped visit form (demo, not live booking).
